{
  "format": "genesis-neurol-corpus-v1",
  "documents": [
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-000",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "Genesis is the model. It handles cognition, inference and planning."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-001",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "Aurora is the engine. It controls execution and runtime resources."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-002",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "Kyro is the interface. It connects the user with the model."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-003",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "A neural suggestion is text. A suggestion does not grant execution permission."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-004",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "Training changes weights. Retrieval reads stored information without changing weights."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-005",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "A checkpoint stores learned weights so the model can be loaded again."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-006",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "The training set changes weights. The validation set helps choose a checkpoint."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-007",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "The test set measures a selected model on examples held apart from training."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-008",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "A measurement records what happened. A prediction states what might happen."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-009",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "Uncertainty should be described when evidence is incomplete."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-010",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "The user controls whether private examples may be used for training."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-011",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "An original synthetic example is a small demonstration, not proof of broad intelligence."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-012",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "The recurrent hidden state carries information from earlier tokens in a sequence."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-013",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "The hidden state starts empty for each independent conversation request."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-014",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "A reset gate controls which earlier hidden features affect the candidate state."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-015",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "An update gate combines the previous state with new candidate information."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-016",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "The output layer assigns scores to possible next bytes."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-017",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "The softmax converts scores into a probability distribution."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-018",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "The optimizer adjusts parameters using gradients of the training loss."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-019",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "Gradient clipping limits the size of a training update."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-020",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "A lower held-out loss indicates improved prediction on that specific dataset."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-021",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "A checksum detects changes when compared with an independently pinned value."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-022",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "A checksum is not a digital signature or proof of trust."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-023",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "A model must not authorize its own access to tools."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-024",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "Aurora admission remains independent of the model output."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-025",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "Kyro displays the state of the selected neural backend."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-026",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "A failed model load leaves neural generation unavailable."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-027",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "An empty generation falls back to the existing Genesis response path."
    },
    {
      "split": "train",
      "group": "train-028",
      "source": "original-synthetic-neurol-v0.1",
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "training_allowed": true,
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "The architecture separates the interface, the model and the engine."
